,0.627,0.456,0.323,0.285,0.259,0.224,0.213,0.185,0.155,0.131,0.118,0.099,0.088,0.208,0.258,0.222,0.167,0.05,0.043,0.037,0.031,0.023,0.018,0.011,0.008,0.005,0.002],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"ADDITIONAL TIPS FOR PARENTS","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"@pet_name has always been fond of ball courts, wanting to stay and play with all the kids well after the bell. Go to your local ball court to look for Squeaky. Let’s ask it together.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":36},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":36},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\"Hi! Have you seen Squeaky?\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"Hi, hi, hi! Check out my new lines – freshly painted, but totally dry. Dribble your way over and start a game.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.16,"end":6.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":21},"large":{"start":0.16,"end":6.3,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"\"No ball? No problem! There’s a stray one over in the corner. Not sure who left it but they won’t mind if you borrow it. Have a bounce! I always say, the best way to pick up your day is to play a little pick-up. [Beat] What do you mean? It’s always time to play ball!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":6.848,"end":21.92,"frac":0.982,"status":"ok","matched":56,"words":57},"large":{"start":6.848,"end":21.5,"frac":0.982,"status":"ok","matched":56,"words":57},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"\"Have I seen a squeak toy? I’ve seen my share, for sure. Big ones, little ones. Shiny ones, fuzzy ones. The court attracts all types.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":22.56,"end":30.04,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"large":{"start":22.56,"end":29.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"\"Oh, your squeak toy? Yeah, yeah. I remember. It looked kinda fruity, like a plum or a big berry. They were having a ball, so to speak, but then the toy – er, Squeaky – got tossed wayyy outta bounds. Your pet went to chase after it and I haven’t seen either of them till you showed up just now.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":30.784,"end":47.86,"frac":0.862,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":58},"large":{"start":30.784,"end":47.74,"frac":0.862,"status":"ok","matched":50,"words":58},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"\"Sorry, champ, I know it isn’t the outcome you were hoping for. But you win some, you lose some. The important thing is you showed up for your team and you had fun. That makes you an A1 player in my books!\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":48.576,"end":61.408,"frac":0.976,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":42},"large":{"start":48.576,"end":61.408,"frac":0.976,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"Share your adventure! Take a photo with your pet in the Story City app and share it with your friends, social media, or otherwise.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":63.936,"end":71.04,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"large":{"start":63.936,"end":70.78,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"We know it’s sad to not find what you were looking for, but you can always try again, right now if you like! Or maybe tomorrow after a game of ball.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":71.2,"end":80.448,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":31},"large":{"start":71.2,"end":80.448,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"If you'd like to take home your very own real life Squeaky toy, you can get one here!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":18},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"Make sure to save your picture before you move on!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":10},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":10},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":null}